# Testing & Benchmarks

- Unit: Vitest for pure TS packages.
- Browser/E2E: Playwright for DOM/drag/resize/React later; smoke only until product logic exists.
- Property-based testing: defer library install until DND-1.3/DND-1.4 needs it.
- Benchmarks: infrastructure only in DND-1.1; no invented FPS/solve-time claims.
